    "description": "Comprehensive API test suite for the CodePulse backend.\n\nFolders:\n- Health Check: Service availability\n- Auth Errors: Authentication failure scenarios\n- Validation Errors: Request validation (requires auth_token)\n- Happy Path: Successful analysis scenarios (requires auth_token + live services)",
